  "story": {
    "text": "Next day Frank rides sixteen miles to London just to have his {HAIR} cut. Mr. Knightley calls him a {TRIFLING}, silly fellow. Then the Coles, who made their money in {BUSINESS}, ask everyone to dinner. Emma means to {REFUSE}, to teach them their place; but when her {INVITATION} comes late, she is {GLAD} to go.",
